   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>FileAccessor contains a common basis for ReadAccessor and WriteAccessor. It provides methods for checking and setting the current position in the file (GetPosition, Set Position, MovePosition, IsEof) and for checking the current size of the file (GetSize).</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
